OL,3,GNEWSATikTok brings fame and queues to
OL,4,ABronte village for autumn
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith its dramatic landscapes and links
OL,7,Fto the Bronte sisters, Haworth has long
OL,8,Fbeen a popular destination for
OL,9,Ftourists.
OL,11,FBut recently, the West Yorkshire
OL,12,Fvillage has been busier than ever,
OL,13,Faccording to some residents and
OL,14,Fbusiness owners, and is now attracting
OL,15,Fa new type of visitor - one brought in
OL,16,Fby how picturesque the place looks on
OL,17,Fsocial media, particularly during
OL,18,Fautumn.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
